# ── External / third-party projects plugged in for testing — NOT our code ──
# Ignore the whole target/ tree EXCEPT our bundled default adapters
# (acea-default-red / acea-default-blue), which the platform ships and needs
# out-of-box. Any third-party projects a user clones in for testing are
# excluded — the platform attaches to them via .env, it does not vendor them.
target/*
!target/red/
!target/blue/
target/red/*
target/blue/*
!target/red/acea-default-red/
!target/blue/acea-default-blue/

# ASIS backups of plugged-in projects (copies of external code)
backup/
gen0/

# Knowledge-graph export
graphify-out/

# OneDrive sync conflict copies
*.original.md

# .env backups (may contain API keys)
.env.bak*

